AIITA Bahadurpura was organizing a Teachers’ Workshop on Friday, 19th December 2025, at MS Mission High School, Hasan Nagar, 

The topic of the workshop is “Effective Classroom Using ChatGPT, Google Gemini, and Notebook LM.” apart from this Ms Firdause sultana from learning link foundation has given wonderful techniques to manage the class room of 21 centutry kids

Approximately 118 teachers are attended this workshop from various schools across Bahadurpura mandal. 

Ms mission High school - 43
Meezan high school- 40
United public school -10
HBS school-13
Bright future school -1
Scholar Techno School -18
Total-118 teachers get benefit from this workshop
